11
00:57:26,666 --> 00:57:32,666
Bill is a 2015 British family adventure comedy film from the principal performers
behind children's TV series Horrible Histories and Yonderland.

12
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
It was produced by Punk Cinema, Cowboy Films and BBC Films and was
released in the UK on 18 September 2015 by Vertigo Films.

13
01:07:53,333 --> 01:07:59,333
The film is a fictional take on the young William Shakespeare's search for fame and fortune, as written by Laurence Rickard and Ben
Willbond and directed by Richard Bracewell who co-produced with Tony Bracewell, Alasdair Flind and Charles Steel.

14
01:13:06,666 --> 01:13:12,666
It features the six lead performers playing several different roles each including Mathew Baynton,
Martha Howe-Douglas, Ben Willbond, Simon Farnaby, Jim Howick and Laurence Rickard.

15
01:18:20,000 --> 01:18:26,000
Bill has received mostly positive reviews from
critics and grossed $968,534 worldwide.

16
01:23:33,333 --> 01:23:39,333
The film also received nominations for the Evening Standard British Film Award for
Award for Comedy and the Into Film Award for Family Film of the Year.

17
01:28:46,666 --> 01:28:52,666
The tone is lighthearted.
